Regression test for reading coupling strengths with ten or more couplings.
Coupling 1 and Coupling 10 are DiffArctan couplings, which give nu_min rather
than nu, so the steady initial potentials of Dendrite 1 and Dendrite 10 must
come from their own nu_min. Earlier versions searched past the end of each
section and used the nu of the next coupling instead. The labels Coupling 1,
Coupling 10 and Coupling 11 share a prefix, and are also mentioned in this
comment and in the population descriptions, none of which may be matched.

